  message: "Population measured while validating WI-ratid-mokat-fifon-hiros-nazun-bozim-mojak-jasin on django (kutal+ratid, ff18f6ceee): 425 call sites whose (caller, ancestor method) pair IS resolved by inherited-calls-linker, but on another line of the same caller, so the site itself has no resolved edge (e.g. AutodetectorTests.test_circular_dependency_swappable2 calls BaseAutodetectorTests.assertOperationTypes at tests/migrations/test_autodetector.py:5316 and :5323; one edge). Before WI-kutal those 425 were bound per-line by py.py's bare-name Case 2a. Rows: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/decontend/run_10032026/ratid/django_recover_rows.json, key still_unresolved_but_pair_resolved_on_other_line."  # 3482
